WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.636
Sparsest cut is hard.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:05.525
Split a network evenly while cutting few links.

3
00:00:05.525 --> 00:00:08.250
The best algorithm loses a root log factor.

4
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.645
Formulas become networks whose cheap cuts decode back into answers.

5
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.146
Claimed: no constant factor is possible.

6
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.584
Lean checks only part.
